marily, “and here’s Mr Browne and Miss Furlong.”"},{"id":"maria","name":"Maria","role":"major","firstAppearance":"s4","summary":"First mention: “The matron had given her leave to go out as soon as the women’s tea was over and Maria looked forward to her evening out.”"},{"id":"mr-holohan","name":"Mr. Holohan","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s6","summary":"First mention: “Mr Holohan, assistant secretary of the _Eire Abu_ Society, had been walking up and down Dublin for nearly a month, with his hands and pockets full of dirty pieces of paper, arranging about the series of concerts.”"},{"id":"coy","name":"Coy","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s8","summary":"First mention: “He was quite unconscious that he was the victim of a plot which his friends, Mr Cunningham, Mr M’Coy and Mr Power had disclosed to Mrs Kernan in the parlour.”"},{"id":"freddy-malins","name":"Freddy Malins","aliases":["Freddy"],"role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s9","summary":"First mention: “Besides they were dreadfully afraid that Freddy Malins might turn up screwed.”"},{"id":"lenehan","name":"Lenehan","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “Most people considered Lenehan a leech but, in spite of this reputation, his adroitness and eloquence had always prevented his friends from forming any general policy against him.”"},{"id":"joe","name":"Joe","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s4","summary":"First mention: “She was very fond of that purse because Joe had brought it to her five years before when he and Alphy had gone to Belfast on a Whit-Monday trip.”"},{"id":"farrington","name":"Farrington","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s4","summary":"First mention: ““Send Farrington here!””"},{"id":"jimmy","name":"Jimmy","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “Jimmy did not study very earnestly and took to bad courses for a while.”"},{"id":"mr-alleyne","name":"Mr. Alleyne","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s4","summary":"First mention: ““Mr Alleyne wants you upstairs.””"},{"id":"mahony","name":"Mahony","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “With Leo Dillon and a boy named Mahony I planned a day’s miching.”"},{"id":"miss-ivors","name":"Miss Ivors","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s10","summary":"First mention: “Gabriel found himself partnered with Miss Ivors.”"},{"id":"mr-hynes","name":"Mr. Hynes","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s5","summary":"First mention: “What are you doing in the dark?” said Mr Hynes advancing into the light of the fire.”"},{"id":"crofton","name":"Crofton","aliases":["Mr. Crofton"],"role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s6","summary":"First mention: “I got him one or two sure things in Dawson Street, Crofton and myself.”"},{"id":"jack","name":"Jack","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “Am I right, Jack?””"},{"id":"mr-fitzpatrick","name":"Mr. Fitzpatrick","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s7","summary":"First mention: “In the dressing-room behind the stage she was introduced to the secretary of the Society, Mr Fitzpatrick.”"},{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s4","summary":"First mention: “Tom.””"},{"id":"mr-fogarty","name":"Mr. Fogarty","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s9","summary":"First mention: ““Mr Fogarty.””"},{"id":"polly","name":"Polly","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: “Polly was a slim girl of nineteen; she had light soft hair and a small full mouth.”"},{"id":"mrs-kernan","name":"Mrs. Kernan","role":"supporting","group":"g-kernan","firstAppearance":"s7","summary":"First mention: “After a while Mrs Kernan entered the kitchen, exclaiming:”"}],"relationships":[{"id":"r1","source":"corley","target":"lenehan","weight":36,"phases":[{"at":"s2","type":"together","label":"Often together","weight":28}]},{"id":"r2","source":"farrington","target":"mr-alleyne","weight":4,"phases":[{"at":"s4","type":"together","la